 """A binary classifier. eval.py calls fit(X, y) on the training split and predict(model, X) on new rows.
 
 X is a float array of shape (n, 16), y is 0/1 of shape (n,). numpy is the only dependency available.
+
+Logistic regression on hand-picked nonlinear features. Inspecting per-feature spline fits showed the
+signal lives in x0..x7 (x8..x15 are flat): an x0*x1 interaction, a sinusoid in x2, quadratics in x3, x4,
+a bowl in x6, and roughly linear x5, x7.
 """
